# Sixth set-family / partition lane — closed with no promotion

2026-09-06 UTC. Result: **7 executed literal attempts, 0 candidates
admitted, 0 reserves, 0 paper numbers**. The seven include the exact old
UZ negative control, and the separate minimum-cardinality blocker probe
MHT. They are not seven certified independent mechanism families.
`NO_PROMOTION / HOLD_EXTERNAL` applies to every row.

The substantive closure is UPC's complete all-parameter adapter: after
fixing reachability, it is complement-of-upper-closure on chain intervals
with free erased branching coordinates. This proves $F^4=F^2$, the full
recurrent core, the sharp height and all inverse fibres, and deducts
both proposed axes. No promising numerical signal is being retained
after its mechanism has been accounted for.

